        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^{18}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}(a^3)^2\\times(a^3)^4&=a^6\\times a^{12}\\\\(a^3)^2\\times(a^3)^4&=a^{18}\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(x^4)^2\\times(x^3)^3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^{17}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}(x^4)^2\\times(x^3)^3&=x^8\\times x^9\\\\(x^4)^2\\times(x^3)^3&=x^{17}\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(b^4)^2\\div(b^3)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$b^2$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}(b^4)^2\\div(b^3)^2&=b^8\\div b^6\\\\(b^4)^2\\div(b^3)^2&=b^2\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{(y^3)^4}{(y^4)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y^4$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(y^3)^4}{(y^4)^2}&=\\frac{y^{12}}{y^8}\\\\\\frac{(y^3)^4}{(y^4)^2}&=y^4\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$2ab^2\\times3a(b^3)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6a^2b^8$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}2ab^2\\times3a(b^3)^2&=6a^2b^2b^6\\\\2ab^2\\times3a(b^3)^2&=6a^2b^8\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 13
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{3ab}{(b^2)^3}\\times\\frac{4b^7}{3a}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4b^2$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3ab}{(b^2)^3}\\times\\frac{4b^7}{3a}&=\\frac{12ab^8}{3ab^6}\\\\\\frac{3ab}{(b^2)^3}\\times\\frac{4b^7}{3a}&=4b^2\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{4(x^3)^2y^4}{3x^4y^3}\\times\\frac{3x^3(y^2)^2}{8xy^5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x^4}{2}$\n\nMultiply the indices within each power, then combine like bases.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4(x^3)^2y^4}{3x^4y^3}\\times\\frac{3x^3(y^2)^2}{8xy^5}&=\\frac{12x^9y^8}{24x^5y^8}\\\\\\frac{4(x^3)^2y^4}{3x^4y^3}\\times\\frac{3x^3(y^2)^2}{8xy^5}&=\\frac{x^4}{2}\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{8a^2(b^3)^2}{3ab^2}\\div\\frac{16a^5b^3}{9(a^3)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3a^2b}{2}$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal of the second fraction, then apply the index laws.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8a^2(b^3)^2}{3ab^2}\\div\\frac{16a^5b^3}{9(a^3)^2}&=\\frac{8a^2b^6}{3ab^2}\\times\\frac{9a^6}{16a^5b^3}\\\\\\frac{8a^2(b^3)^2}{3ab^2}\\div\\frac{16a^5b^3}{9(a^3)^2}&=\\frac{72a^8b^6}{48a^6b^5}\\\\\\frac{8a^2(b^3)^2}{3ab^2}\\div\\frac{16a^5b^3}{9(a^3)^2}&=\\frac{3a^2b}{2}\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q15-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{3(x^3y)^2}{(x^2y)^2}\\div\\frac{12x^4y^2}{(2x^3y)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^4$\n\nRaise every factor in each bracket to the power, then multiply by the reciprocal.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3(x^3y)^2}{(x^2y)^2}\\div\\frac{12x^4y^2}{(2x^3y)^2}&=\\frac{3x^6y^2}{x^4y^2}\\times\\frac{4x^6y^2}{12x^4y^2}\\\\\\frac{3(x^3y)^2}{(x^2y)^2}\\div\\frac{12x^4y^2}{(2x^3y)^2}&=\\frac{12x^{12}y^4}{12x^8y^4}\\\\\\frac{3(x^3y)^2}{(x^2y)^2}\\div\\frac{12x^4y^2}{(2x^3y)^2}&=x^4\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      }
    ]
